"children\":\"2026年9月1日台股盤後：加權漲逾1.7%，半導體領軍上攻\"}],[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\",\"children\":\"本文目錄\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-1\",\"children\":\"一、大盤表現與市場氣氛\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-2\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-2\",\"children\":\"二、族群強弱分析\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-3\",\"children\":\"三、個股漲跌幅與當沖觀察\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-4\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-4\",\"children\":\"四、法人動向與市場籌碼\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-5\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-5\",\"children\":\"五、國際盤勢與新聞焦點\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-6\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-6\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-7\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-7\",\"children\":\"總結\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-8\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-8\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\",\"children\":\"今天，2026年9月1日，台股大盤呈現顯著上漲。加權指數收盤來到46948.72點，上漲了+1.77%，而櫃買指數也同步走強，上漲了+2.25%，收在410.77點。整體市場氣氛偏向積極，其中半導體族群的表現是盤面一大焦點。\"}],[],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\",\"children\":\"本文重點\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"加權指數上漲1.77%，櫃買指數漲逾2%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"半導體族群領漲，數位雲端同步走強。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"外資現貨買超，自營商現貨賣超。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"台指期外資淨空單仍維持高位。\"}]]}]]}],[[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-1\",{\"id\":\"sec-1\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"一、大盤表現與市場氣氛\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"2026年9月1日，台股大盤展現了強勁的上升動能。加權指數今日收盤為46948.72點，相較前一個交易日上漲了1.77%。同時，櫃買指數也表現不俗，收在410.77點，漲幅達到2.25%。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"今日上市股票中，有555家上漲，340家下跌，平均漲跌幅為+0.62%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"今日上市總成交金額約為10235.0億元。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"指數名稱\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"收盤價\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"漲跌幅\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"加權指數\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"46948.72\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+1.77%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"櫃買指數\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"410.77\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+2.25%\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-2\",{\"id\":\"sec-2\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"二、族群強弱分析\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"從今日各產業族群的表現來看，科技相關類股展現了強勁的領漲力道。半導體業、數位雲端類以及其他電子業均有顯著漲幅，而部分非電子類股則呈現小幅下跌。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"半導體業今日有174檔股票，數位雲端類有4檔股票。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"領漲個股3529 力旺在半導體業中表現突出，6870 騰雲則在數位雲端類中領漲。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"偏強族群\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"漲跌幅\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"領漲個股（今日結果）\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"半導體業\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+2.31%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"3529 力旺\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"數位雲端類\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+1.80%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"6870 騰雲\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"其他電子業\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+1.75%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"6830 汎銓\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"ETF\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+1.62%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"0050 元大台灣50\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"偏弱族群\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"漲跌幅\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"\"}]]}],\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\"]}]]}]}]]]}],\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\"],null]}]]}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"5\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"綠能環保類\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.78%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"\"}]]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"6\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"存託憑證\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.61%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"7\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"生技醫療業\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.34%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"\"}]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"8\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"造紙工業\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.33%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"\"}]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-3\",{\"id\":\"sec-3\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"三、個股漲跌幅與當沖觀察\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"在個股表現方面，今日有多檔股票達到漲停板，顯示市場資金的集中。同時，也有部分個股出現較大幅度的下跌。當沖交易則在特定股票上呈現高量比。\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"今日上市漲幅榜：2243 宏旭-KY 上漲 +10.00%（量 356 張）、2434 統懋 上漲 +10.00%（量 389 張）、6830 汎銓 上漲 +10.00%（量 2997 張）、3518 柏騰 上漲 +9.98%（量 2878 張）、6933 AMAX-KY 上漲 +9.97%（量 3418 張）、3715 定穎投控 上漲 +9.96%（量 9357 張）。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"今日上市跌幅榜：2491 吉祥全 下跌 -9.94%（量 1717 張）、3605 宏致 下跌 -9.71%（量 7867 張）、3543 州巧 下跌 -9.38%（量 6418 張）、2033 佳大 下跌 -8.08%（量 3447 張）、9941 裕融 下跌 -7.94%（量 3991 張）、1516 川飛 下跌 -5.48%（量 38 張）。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"當沖熱門股票（量比高）：晶宏 今日量比 9.9x（上漲 +9.96%）、漢達 今日量比 9.8x（下跌 -6.57%）、瑞峰 今日量比 7.0x（上漲 +14.93%）。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"!外資期貨淨空單!國際股市波動!個股漲跌分歧!融資維持率\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"投資人關注\"}]]}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、法人動向與市場籌碼\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"在法人交易方面，外資在現貨市場呈現買超，而自營商則為賣超。台指期貨今日收盤價上漲，但外資在台指期的淨空單部位仍維持在較高水平。全市場的融資維持率顯示了整體槓桿狀況。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"外資今日現貨買超約271,137張。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"自營商今日現貨賣超約692,661張。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"台指期今日收盤價為47209.0點，上漲2.67%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"台指期未平倉口數為104368口。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"外資台指期淨空單為78,706口。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":\"全市場融資維持率為192.3%。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"項目\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"今日結果\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"外資現貨買賣超\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"約 271,137 張\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"自營商現貨買賣超\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"約 -692,661 張\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"台指期收盤價\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"47209.0 (+2.67%)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"台指期未平倉口數\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"104368 口\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"外資台指期淨空單\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"78,706 口\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"5\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"全市場融資維持率\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"192.3%\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、國際盤勢與新聞焦點\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"今日國際主要股市表現不一，美國主要指數普遍呈現小幅下跌，而亞洲市場則有漲有跌。國內方面，與重要科技公司相關的新聞持續受到市場關注。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"今日台股相關新聞標題提及2330 台積電的資訊，內容包括高價股波動、獲利重要性、先進矽系統整合、矽光子與CoWoS加速AI效能，以及先進封裝的重要性等。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"近三日國際新聞標題則關注美國對台政策在川普時期將受密切觀察，以及中國領導人習近平在川普缺席下填補外交空缺等議題。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"主要國際指數\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"今日漲跌幅\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"S&P 500\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.58%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"那斯達克\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.64%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"費城半導體\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-2.92%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"韓國綜合 (KOSPI)\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+0.23%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"日經 225\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.15%\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"今天台股大盤表現如何？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"2026年9月1日，加權指數上漲1.77%，收在46948.72點。櫃買指數也上漲2.25%，收在410.77點，整體市場呈現上漲格局。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"哪些族群今天表現比較好？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"今日表現較強的族群包括半導體業上漲2.31%、數位雲端類上漲1.80%、以及其他電子業上漲1.75%。ETF類股也同步上漲1.62%。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"外資今天在台股做了什麼？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"外資在現貨市場買超約271,137張。在台指期貨部分，外資的淨空單部位為78,706口，台指期今日收盤上漲2.67%。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"國際股市今天表現如何？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"美國主要指數如S&P 500下跌0.58%、那斯達克下跌0.64%、費城半導體下跌2.92%。亞洲市場則有韓國綜合指數上漲0.23%、日經225指數下跌0.15%的表現。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"2026年9月1日，台股大盤展現強勁上漲動能，加權與櫃買指數均錄得顯著漲幅，主要由半導體族群的亮眼表現帶動，市場成交金額也突破兆元關卡。\"}]]]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-台股學堂\",{\"href\":\"/school\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"台股學堂\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-台股教學專欄\",{\"href\":\"/learn\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"台股教學專欄\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-大盤總覽（會員）\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"大盤總覽（會員）\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-族群透視（會員）\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"族群透視（會員）\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n13:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nf:null\n22:I[80622,[],\"IconMark\"]\n11:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"2026年9月1日台股盤後：加權漲逾1.7%，半導體領軍上攻｜股市大佬 TradeBoss\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"今天，2026年9月1日，台股大盤呈現顯著上漲。加權指數收盤來到46948.72點，上漲了+1.77%，而櫃買指數也同步走強，上漲了+2.25%，收在410.77點。整體市場氣氛偏向積極，其中半導體族群的表現是盤面一大焦點。\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"16x16\"}],[\"$\",\"$L22\",\"3\",{}]],\"error\":null,\"digest\":\"$undefined\"}\n16:\"$11:metadata\"\n"}